# Implementation Plan — Sprint-004: Delayed Human Typing & Dynamic Target Acquisition Engine

## Overview
Sprint-004 delivers a production-grade, thread-safe, high-performance **Human Typing Engine** with **Delayed Countdown** and **Dynamic Target Acquisition & Validation**.

The engine allows users to trigger a typing job, switch to any external application (Notepad, VS Code, Browser, ChatGPT, Google Docs, WhatsApp, etc.), place their cursor inside an editable field, and have typing execute automatically at the currently focused control after a configurable countdown.

