> **Zero-Dependency OS Target Acquisition & Platform Abstraction**: Target window detection (`GetForegroundWindow`), focused control validation (`GetGUIThreadInfo`, `GetFocus`), and OS keystroke sending (`SendInput` via `ctypes.windll.user32`) are encapsulated in `src/platform/windows_target.py` behind platform interfaces (`ITargetAcquirer`, `IKeyInputSender`). Unit tests utilize `MockTargetAcquirer` and `MockKeyInputSender` for 100% deterministic testing without requiring interactive desktop windows.

