## Execution Pipeline Architecture

```
[User Clicks "Start Typing"]
          │
          ▼
┌───────────────────┐
│ Countdown Started │  (0s, 3s, 5s, 10s default, 15s, 30s, Custom)
└─────────┬─────────┘  Emits: CountdownStarted, CountdownTick(remaining)
          │
          ▼
┌───────────────────┐
│    Target         │  (Executed IMMEDIATELY at T=0s before first keystroke)
│  Acquisition      │  Detects current foreground window, process name, focused control handle
└─────────┬─────────┘
          │
          ▼
┌───────────────────┐  Safety Validation Rules:
│    Target         │  ✓ Foreground window exists?
│   Validation      │  ✓ Focused control exists?
└────┬─────────┬────┘  ✓ Focused control accepts keyboard input / is editable?
     │         │       ✗ Fails if Desktop, Taskbar, Explorer background, or disabled control
 PASS│         │FAIL
     │         └───► Emits: TargetValidationFailed("No editable text field is currently focused.")
     ▼               Displays user alert; typing ABORTED safely.
┌───────────────────┐
│ Target Acquired   │  Emits: TargetAcquired(title, process, control_type)
└─────────┬─────────┘
          │
          ▼
┌───────────────────┐
│  Typing Plan      │  Generates & executes TypingPlan (variable WPM, digraphs, jitter,
│    Execution      │  typo simulation + backspace correction, multi-line, Unicode/emoji)
└─────────┬─────────┘
          │
          ▼
┌───────────────────┐
│   Completion      │  Emits: Completed(job_id, duration_seconds)
└───────────────────┘
```

