## Verification Plan

### Automated Unit Tests (`tests/unit/`)
- `test_typing_config.py`: Default values, delay bounds, Pydantic validations.
- `test_typing_simulator.py`: Action sequence generation, digraph timings, QWERTY mistake & backspace physics, grapheme cluster Unicode/emoji support, multi-line, paste threshold fallback.
- `test_typing_target_validation.py`: Safety rules verification (Desktop, Taskbar, non-editable control rejection vs valid editor acceptance).
- `test_typing_worker_countdown.py`: Countdown ticks, cancellation during countdown, dynamic target acquisition timing (verifying target is NOT cached before countdown ends).
- `test_typing_queue.py`: Thread-safe FIFO/Priority job queuing, job cancellation tokens.
- `test_typing_engine.py`: Facade API integration, signal broadcasts, end-to-end execution.

Target test coverage: **≥95.0% coverage** on `src/typing/` and `src/platform/`.

